00:38:32.396 --> 00:38:36.376
Maybe you could ask the people themselves how that would impact them.

677
00:38:36.456 --> 00:38:39.296
Yeah. Well, we've got Auckland City Mission coming up, so-

678
00:38:39.656 --> 00:38:42.736
Maybe you could ask the people who this will affect

679
00:38:43.096 --> 00:38:44.676
directly the question.

680
00:38:44.816 --> 00:38:45.556
Yeah. Thank you.

681
00:38:47.976 --> 00:38:48.456
If we have time.

682
00:38:48.676 --> 00:38:48.856
Yes.

683
00:38:48.896 --> 00:38:52.596
Thank you. Look, thank you. And I'm really loving all the teaching everyone about

