00:38:58.596 --> 00:39:02.566
when we apply compassion for our neighbors, what about those that are trying to

687
00:39:02.636 --> 00:39:06.466
run a business to provide some kai for their families,

688
00:39:06.916 --> 00:39:10.216
and that are really struggling to get patrons, as I've been told in South Auckland,

