720
00:40:39.936 --> 00:40:42.496
Lovely. Thank you for having me here today, Kia ora.

721
00:40:43.926 --> 00:40:47.816
My name is Nicola Houben, and I speak to you today as a barrister.

722
00:40:48.816 --> 00:40:52.646
I'd like to open with a distinction articulated by Dr.

723
00:40:52.856 --> 00:40:55.276
Martin Luther King Jr. and I quote,

724
00:40:56.076 --> 00:40:59.936
"An unjust law is a human code that is not rooted in eternal

725
00:41:00.016 --> 00:41:00.896
or natural law.

726
00:41:01.776 --> 00:41:05.276
Any law that degrades human personality is unjust."

727
00:41:06.596 --> 00:41:10.276
The proposed Summary Offences Bill completely fails this fundamental

728
00:41:10.396 --> 00:41:13.996
test. It is a framework that degrades human personality,

729
00:41:14.196 --> 00:41:16.856
and I stand in absolute opposition to it.

730
00:41:17.956 --> 00:41:21.676
The core flaw of this bill is structural, and as legal practitioners,

731
00:41:22.056 --> 00:41:25.496
we must ask what the mischief that this proposed

732
00:41:25.536 --> 00:41:27.756
legislation seeks to address.

733
00:41:28.656 --> 00:41:32.496
If the mischief is public safety, commercial intimidation, or obstruction,

734
00:41:32.956 --> 00:41:35.056
our statute books already cover this.

735
00:41:35.676 --> 00:41:38.356
The Summary Offences Act 1981 robustly

736
00:41:38.456 --> 00:41:42.176
criminalizes disorderly, offensive, and threatening behavior.

737
00:41:42.916 --> 00:41:46.516
The proposed bill is therefore legally redundant for safety.

738
00:41:47.196 --> 00:41:50.966
Its true target is the public visibility

739
00:41:51.156 --> 00:41:51.936
