4961
05:45:59.853 --> 05:46:02.904
They're sleeping rough because they have nowhere else to go.

4962
05:46:02.964 --> 05:46:06.474
Our experience tells us that many people simply do not have

4963
05:46:06.504 --> 05:46:10.064
another safe place available to them.

4964
05:46:10.104 --> 05:46:14.073
If someone is directed to leave one public place but has nowhere safe to go, we've

4965
05:46:14.084 --> 05:46:16.704
