4971
05:46:35.754 --> 05:46:38.714
time this evening. I know it's been a long couple of days, but we appreciate your

4972
05:46:38.744 --> 05:46:42.644
time. Thank you, Stella. As the chair of Kim's Way, I've had the privilege

4973
05:46:42.684 --> 05:46:46.644
