5007
05:48:48.560 --> 05:48:52.420
From a governance perspective, we believe community safety and compassion

5008
05:48:52.480 --> 05:48:56.020
are not competing priorities. They actually strengthen one another.

5009
05:48:56.520 --> 05:48:59.980
Communities become safer when fewer

5010
05:49:00.260 --> 05:49:02.260
